{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GORE</strong> is a\u00a0<strong>found footage horror experience</strong> that immerses players in an unknown mountain range designed to resemble the scenery of the Pacific Northwest in the United States. Drawing inspiration from the many works of\u00a0<i>Lovecraft</i>,\u00a0<i>Fears to Fathom: Ironbark Lookout,</i>\u00a0and <i>John Carpenter\u2019s The Thing</i>, this game pulls you deep into a decaying wilderness where something horrible is rapidly spreading through the surrounding environment. You must discover where this fleshy entity came from,\u00a0armed with only a flashlight and handheld camera.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time with this game, do not rush through it - it is meant to be an an environmental horror as much as it is meant to be visually appealing and was built to be a euphoric and peaceful &quot;hiking simulator&quot; of sorts, but will fall into chaos soon enough.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>This game includes:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Handheld/ VHS-like post-processing and movements, creating a nostalgic experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Two <strong>fleshed out</strong> (pun intended) levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Completely custom Mountain Range + Landscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Toggleable flashlight for darker areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; A linear story with reliance on environmental and psychological horror aspects. Story is (mostly) told through the players' inner dialogue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One primary ending, one fun ending (may add more later)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One insane twist that you don't want to miss out on!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943880?t=1755921772","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943880?t=1755921772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/892e1461274904db332f13de920b95d0f76e67ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755921772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/892e1461274904db332f13de920b95d0f76e67ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755921772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"GORE\" contains an alien, fleshy bio-mass that squelches and sometimes hisses - it is scattered all throughout the game. The bio-mass closely resembled dismembered remains and may be disturbing at times."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GORE</strong> is a\u00a0<strong>found footage horror experience</strong> that immerses players in an unknown mountain range designed to resemble the scenery of the Pacific Northwest in the United States. Drawing inspiration from the many works of\u00a0<i>Lovecraft</i>,\u00a0<i>Fears to Fathom: Ironbark Lookout,</i>\u00a0and <i>John Carpenter\u2019s The Thing</i>, this game pulls you deep into a decaying wilderness where something horrible is rapidly spreading through the surrounding environment. You must discover where this fleshy entity came from,\u00a0armed with only a flashlight and handheld camera.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time with this game, do not rush through it - it is meant to be an an environmental horror as much as it is meant to be visually appealing and was built to be a euphoric and peaceful &quot;hiking simulator&quot; of sorts, but will fall into chaos soon enough.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>This game includes:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Handheld/ VHS-like post-processing and movements, creating a nostalgic experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Two <strong>fleshed out</strong> (pun intended) levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Completely custom Mountain Range + Landscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Toggleable flashlight for darker areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; A linear story with reliance on environmental and psychological horror aspects. Story is (mostly) told through the players' inner dialogue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One primary ending, one fun ending (may add more later)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One insane twist that you don't want to miss out on!</p>","developers":["CosmicArcade"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/dce7b9426c6a23cc3dc87a33bce86d8b1421cc33/header.jpg?t=1755921772","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184491,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184491/movie480.mp4?t=1755458961","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184491/movie_max.mp4?t=1755458961"},"name":"GORE Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184491/8b744d641d577fbf0e7be4123b41097270aaea31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755458961","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184491/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755458961","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184491/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755458961"}}],"name":"GORE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:<